exit: 2
bin: BIN
description: Read and operate an AxeOS Bitcoin miner from a predictable command line
error:
  code: host_required
  message: set --host <address> or AXEOS_HOST
help: Run `axeos-axi discover` to find miners on the local network; Run `axeos-axi --host <address>` to read one miner; Run `axeos-axi host save <address>` to save a default host
